        "bio": "<p>Asif Kabani, MD, specializes in Internal Medicine with a focus on primary care, lifestyle medicine, obesity management, and global health. Commencing practice in 2023, he is certified by the American Board of Internal Medicine.</p>\n<p>Asif completed his education at McGovern Medical School at UTHealth Houston and his residency at Texas Health Dallas. He holds a double major in Biochemistry and Healthcare Studies from the University of Texas at Dallas. He is actively involved in medical associations like American College of Physicians, American Medical Association, and Texas Medical Association.</p>\n<p>Outside of practice, Asif enjoys dance classes, exploring Houston's culinary scene, reading, sports, podcasts, and music. Coming from a Pakistani background, he values family and is the eldest of three siblings.</p>",
