        "bio": "<p><span>Dr. Michael Mgerian (pronounced “Muh-gair-ian”) has been practicing since 2019 and is board-certified by the American Board of Family Medicine. His area of focus is primary care, preventive medicine, with a keen interest in diabetes management and musculoskeletal pathology. </span></p>\n<p><span>Dr. Mgerian studied biochemistry and received his Bachelor of Science at the University of California, Los Angeles. Prior to medical school Dr. Mgerian as an EMT in Los Angeles. He attended medical school at American University of the Caribbean, School of Medicine with medical clerkships at Staten Island University Hospital, New York. He completed his residency Family Medicine at HCA Houston Healthcare at the University of Houston. </span></p>\n<p><span>On a personal note, Dr. Mgerian enjoys camping, hiking, SCUBA diving, working out and spending time at the gym; he is also interested in aviation and aerospace.</span></p>",
