        "bio": "<p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Dr. Alan Tran is a dedicated provider who focuses on delivering high quality care to his patients. He started practicing in 1995 with medical interest in preventive care. He </span><span style=\"color: black;\">performs adult physical exams and specializes in family medicine. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: black;\">Dr. Tran earned his undergraduate degree in biology and chemistry from Houston Baptist University. He then attended medical school at McGovern Medical School at The University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston. He then completed his residency work at CHRISTUS Spohn Hospital Corpus Christi - Memorial. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: black;\">When he’s not helping his patients, Dr. Tran enjoys playing tennis. He is fluent in Vietnamese. </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
